 Develop&nbsp;and&nbsp;implement&nbsp;strategies&nbsp;to&nbsp;improve&nbsp;product&nbsp;quality&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;customer's&nbsp;perspective&nbsp;in&nbsp;General&nbsp;Assembly &nbsp; 

